      "quote": "Not to put my tinfoil hat on but\u2026 are pollsters now doing this intentionally to suppress normie voter turnout? \n\nWhy are all the DSA candidates up by so much in these polls and then\u2026 barely or fail to deliver (El-Sayed, Hong)"
